    {"id":"117125384303241460","created_at":"2026-08-20T02:05:22Z","in_reply_to_id":"117116825270502486","in_reply_to_account_id":"115547686216532430","sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"zh-CN","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s/statuses/117125383650162144","url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s/117125383650162144","replies_count":4,"reblogs_count":5,"favourites_count":44,"quotes_count":0,"edited_at":null,"favourited":false,"reblogged":false,"muted":false,"bookmarked":false,"content":"<p>我这个砖抛出来之后，真是收到源源不断的新玉啊。</p><p>朋友的表弟回国找工作，跟他妈说有人帮他介绍了工作但是要花50万，他妈也就是朋友的姑姑来问她此时是否靠谱。</p><p>朋友：我都是自己面试找到的工作，对花钱找工作这个领域不是很了解。</p><p>哈哈哈哈哈哈哈</p>","filtered":[],"reblog":null,"account":{"id":"115547686216532430","username":"yun5s","acct":"yun5s@go5.dev","display_name":"云五 | 古希腊消灭内耗的神","locked":false,"bot":false,"url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s","followers_count":5816,"following_count":191,"statuses_count":8892,"note":"","avatar":"","avatar_static":"","header":"","header_static":"","emojis":[],"fields":[]},"media_attachments":[],"mentions":[],"tags":[],"emojis":[],"card":null,"poll":null},
