    {"id":"117117326607241672","created_at":"2026-08-18T15:56:15Z","in_reply_to_id":"117117319924803954","in_reply_to_account_id":"115548714585672690","sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"zh-CN","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s/statuses/117117326138208939","url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s/117117326138208939","replies_count":0,"reblogs_count":4,"favourites_count":20,"quotes_count":0,"edited_at":null,"favourited":false,"reblogged":false,"muted":false,"bookmarked":false,"content":"<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://go5.dev/@teabagpot\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>teabagpot</span></a></span> </p><p>以前在天涯看过服刑人员写的科普贴里，他们在监狱里也是可以买一些东西的，这些钱就得靠父母存，如果没人存你在里面就没钱花。。。（听着都有点像烧纸钱了。。。</p>","filtered":[],"reblog":null,"account":{"id":"115547686216532430","username":"yun5s","acct":"yun5s@go5.dev","display_name":"云五 | 古希腊消灭内耗的神","locked":false,"bot":false,"url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s","followers_count":5816,"following_count":191,"statuses_count":8892,"note":"","avatar":"","avatar_static":"","header":"","header_static":"","emojis":[],"fields":[]},"media_attachments":[],"mentions":[{"id":"115548714585672690","username":"teabagpot","url":"https://go5.dev/@teabagpot","acct":"teabagpot@go5.dev"}],"tags":[],"emojis":[],"card":null,"poll":null},
    {"id":"117117388752166120","created_at":"2026-08-18T16:12:10Z","in_reply_to_id":"117117285240878821","in_reply_to_account_id":"115548714585672690","sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"zh-TW","uri":"https://mas.to/users/ling/statuses/117117388745651882","url":"https://mas.to/@ling/117117388745651882","replies_count":1,"reblogs_count":60,"favourites_count":75,"quotes_count":0,"edited_at":"2026-08-19T15:16:47Z","favourited":false,"reblogged":false,"muted":false,"bookmarked":false,"content":"<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://go5.dev/@teabagpot\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>teabagpot</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://go5.dev/@yun5s\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>yun5s</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://go5.dev/@fancheyu\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>fancheyu</span></a></span> </p><p>探监确实要花钱，开支有两项：<br>1. 一般来说，本地监狱通常不关押本地户籍的囚犯。比如广州人在广州的法院受审判刑后，会从广州的看守所押送到梅州或茂名的监狱服刑。异地坐牢，家属探监一次去两个人，往返车费、食宿，是一大开支。<br>2. 监狱里衣食住行由政府出钱，但是香皂、卫生纸、洗衣粉、脫水蔬菜、豆瓣醬、卫生巾、花生瓜子辣条饼干可乐香烟等日常用品得囚犯自己花钱买，所以探监的时候会顺便给亲人存三五百生活费。 </p><p>监狱往往盖在偏郊，国内的信息保密规定地图软件不准标识监狱的位置，app上搜不到地址，沒法直接导航过去，第一次探监的人很要费些周折打听寻找，方见到大门。</p>","filtered":[],"reblog":null,"account":{"id":"116293851120326088","username":"ling","acct":"ling@mas.to","display_name":"令和猛犸","locked":false,"bot":false,"url":"https://mas.to/@ling","uri":"https://mas.to/users/ling","followers_count":373,"following_count":788,"statuses_count":233,"note":"","avatar":"","avatar_static":"","header":"","header_static":"","emojis":[],"fields":[]},"media_attachments":[],"mentions":[{"id":"115548714585672690","username":"teabagpot","url":"https://go5.dev/@teabagpot","acct":"teabagpot@go5.dev"},{"id":"115547686216532430","username":"yun5s","url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s","acct":"yun5s@go5.dev"},{"i