    {"id":"117117690501302044","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:28:44Z","in_reply_to_id":"117117671906983881","in_reply_to_account_id":"115580164580708430","sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"zh-CN","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s/statuses/117117689817404908","url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s/117117689817404908","replies_count":1,"reblogs_count":0,"favourites_count":6,"quotes_count":0,"edited_at":null,"favourited":false,"reblogged":false,"muted":false,"bookmarked":false,"content":"<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.butnot.today/@zillionk\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zillionk</span></a></span> </p><p>真的好难想象到底这些钱是怎么欠出来的</p><p>这个朋友老家在比较富裕的县城，但我老家是全国贫困县。。。就这样村里都有人能做诈骗做到倒欠60万，还有人筹钱捞小孩，都不知道他们哪里搞到的钱。。。</p><p>还有一个朋友的亲戚去年也有类似的事情，但是是老年人搞出来的，数额也是500+万，天南地北的地方都有这种事，真的好震撼。。。</p>","filtered":[],"reblog":null,"account":{"id":"115547686216532430","username":"yun5s","acct":"yun5s@go5.dev","display_name":"云五 | 古希腊消灭内耗的神","locked":false,"bot":false,"url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s","followers_count":5816,"following_count":191,"statuses_count":8892,"note":"","avatar":"","avatar_static":"","header":"","header_static":"","emojis":[],"fields":[]},"media_attachments":[],"mentions":[{"id":"115580164580708430","username":"zillionk","url":"https://social.butnot.today/@zillionk","acct":"zillionk@social.butnot.today"}],"tags":[],"emojis":[],"card":null,"poll":null},
