    {"id":"117117722536517682","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:36:56Z","in_reply_to_id":"117117710761330698","in_reply_to_account_id":"115580164580708430","sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"zh-CN","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s/statuses/117117722081081553","url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s/117117722081081553","replies_count":1,"reblogs_count":0,"favourites_count":5,"quotes_count":0,"edited_at":null,"favourited":false,"reblogged":false,"muted":false,"bookmarked":false,"content":"<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.butnot.today/@zillionk\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zillionk</span></a></span> </p><p>应该是，还有一个亲戚的小孩，前几年挪用公款去赌博，不幸中的万幸是20万时就被发现了，公司答应如果把钱填上就可以不报警——结果就坑了他弟弟工作几年攒下来的准备结婚的钱……</p><p>他弟弟经此一役火速跑路，立刻去女朋友家乡所在省份（离我们老家十万八千里）找了工作结婚再也不回来了 😂</p>","filtered":[],"reblog":null,"account":{"id":"115547686216532430","username":"yun5s","acct":"yun5s@go5.dev","display_name":"云五 | 古希腊消灭内耗的神","locked":false,"bot":false,"url":"https://go5.dev/@yun5s","uri":"https://go5.dev/users/yun5s","followers_count":5816,"following_count":191,"statuses_count":8892,"note":"","avatar":"","avatar_static":"","header":"","header_static":"","emojis":[],"fields":[]},"media_attachments":[],"mentions":[{"id":"115580164580708430","username":"zillionk","url":"https://social.butnot.today/@zillionk","acct":"zillionk@social.butnot.today"}],"tags":[],"emojis":[],"card":null,"poll":null},
